OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1946, Mexican American Raoul
OL,7,     FCortez launched the first US radio
OL,8,     Fservice in Spanish. Based in San
OL,9,     FAntonio, Texas, he used charm and
OL,10,     Fcreativity to win over
OL,11,     Fadvertisers.
